    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47206" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllŏgismus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-os</span></b>  (syllogismus, <i><span class="en">Sid. Pan.
